          With topology-aware model:
            if (topology contains "doherty") {
              # Doherty maintains efficiency at backoff via load modulation
              # η(p) = η_peak × √(p/p_max) for p ≤ p_max/2 (main PA only)
              # At 6dB OBO: √(0.25) = 0.5 → η_obo = 0.5 × η_peak
